<%# D11: say plainly where these answers come from, and point at a human. A
    confidently wrong copay is the most harmful thing this app can produce, so
    the invitation to check is permanent rather than a one-time dismissable tip. %>
<aside class="bg-notice-bg text-notice-ink rounded-lg p-5 mb-8 text-body">
  <p>
    Everything here comes from the document you added. We may have read something
    wrong.
    <% if (phone = current_insurance_session&.field(:customer_service_phone)).present? %>
      To be sure, call your plan on <strong class="whitespace-nowrap"><%= phone %></strong>.
    <% else %>
      To be sure, call the number on your insurance card.
    <% end %>
  </p>
</aside>
